From ccc459ccc0fe1f6838a13b9828613af1ac8a1261 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AlphaWRT <build@alphawrt.invalid>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 11:29:01 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] mt76: offload MT7916 RX to the EN7523 NPU

Off by default (mt7915e npu_enable=1). The NPU takes the MAIN and BAND1
RX rings; the host reads its WLAN RX rings and feeds unbound PPE flows
to airoha_ppe so Wi-Fi to WAN flows can bind. The GN630V wifi node
gets airoha,npu and airoha,eth so mt7915e can find the NPU and PPE.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
